('index.s050', 'index', '首页', '国际顾问委员会完成首轮方法学评审', 'International advisory board completes first methodological review', '国际顾问委员会完成首轮方法学评审', 'International advisory board completes first methodological review', '0', 195),
('index.s051', 'index', '首页', '来自中韩的循证医学、指南方法学与针灸临床专家完成对 ACTION 规范与工具的首轮联合评审。', 'Experts in evidence-based medicine, guideline methodology and acupuncture from China and Korea completed the first joint review of ACTION''s guidelines and tools.', '来自中韩的循证医学、指南方法学与针灸临床专家完成对 ACTION 规范与工具的首轮联合评审。', 'Experts in evidence-based medicine, guideline methodology and acupuncture from China and Korea completed the first joint review of ACTION''s guidelines and tools.', '0', 196),
('index.s052', 'index', '首页', '资源中心', 'Resource centre', '资源中心', 'Resource centre', '0', 197),
('index.s053', 'index', '首页', '国际组织与循证枢纽', 'International organisations & evidence hubs', '国际组织与循证枢纽', 'International organisations & evidence hubs', '0', 198),
('index.s054', 'index', '首页', '快速访问 ACTION 规范体系所依据的国际报告规范组织与循证资源。', 'Quick access to the international reporting-guideline organisations and evidence resources that ACTION''s guideline system builds on.', '快速访问 ACTION 规范体系所依据的国际报告规范组织与循证资源。', 'Quick access to the international reporting-guideline organisations and evidence resources that ACTION''s guideline system builds on.', '0', 199),
('index.s056', 'index', '首页', '（在新窗口打开）', '(opens in new tab)', '（在新窗口打开）', '(opens in new tab)', '0', 200),
('index._title', 'index', '首页', 'ACTION {''|''} 针刺临床研究智能平台 · 广州医科大学附属中医医院', 'ACTION {''|''} 针刺临床研究智能平台 · 广州医科大学附属中医医院', 'ACTION {''|''} 针刺临床研究智能平台 · 广州医科大学附属中医医院', 'ACTION {''|''} 针刺临床研究智能平台 · 广州医科大学附属中医医院', '0', 201),
('index._desc', 'index', '首页', 'ACTION（ACupuncTure Intelligent helper ON clinical research）是面向针刺临床研究的数字化资源平台：主持针刺专属报告规范，提供报告助手与实施科学工具，汇聚专家协作，帮助全球研究者产出可被信任的循证证据。', 'ACTION (ACupuncTure Intelligent helper ON clinical research) is a digital resource platform for acupuncture clinical research: it stewards acupuncture-specific reporting guidelines, provides a reporting assistant and implementation-science tools, and convenes expert collaboration — helping researchers worldwide produce evidence that can be trusted.', 'ACTION（ACupuncTure Intelligent helper ON clinical research）是面向针刺临床研究的数字化资源平台：主持针刺专属报告规范，提供报告助手与实施科学工具，汇聚专家协作，帮助全球研究者产出可被信任的循证证据。', 'ACTION (ACupuncTure Intelligent helper ON clinical research) is a digital resource platform for acupuncture clinical research: it stewards acupuncture-specific reporting guidelines, provides a reporting assistant and implementation-science tools, and convenes expert collaboration — helping researchers worldwide produce evidence that can be trusted.', '0', 202),
('about.s001', 'about', '关于我们', '我们做什么 · 如何组织', 'What we do & how we are organised', '我们做什么 · 如何组织', 'What we do & how we are organised', '0', 203),
('about.s002', 'about', '关于我们', '我们做什么，如何组织', 'What we do, and how we are organised', '我们做什么，如何组织', 'What we do, and how we are organised', '0', 204),
('about.s003', 'about', '关于我们', 'ACTION 整合循证报告规范、智能研究工具与能力建设资源，由临床流行病学、针灸临床、实施科学与健康信息学等多学科专家联合建设，服务全球研究者、临床医师、方法学家与期刊编辑。', 'ACTION integrates evidence-based reporting standards, intelligent research tools and capacity-building resources. Built by a multidisciplinary consortium of clinical epidemiologists, acupuncture clinicians, implementation scientists and health-informatics experts, it serves researchers, practitioners, methodologists and journal editors worldwide.', 'ACTION 整合循证报告规范、智能研究工具与能力建设资源，由临床流行病学、针灸临床、实施科学与健康信息学等多学科专家联合建设，服务全球研究者、临床医师、方法学家与期刊编辑。', 'ACTION integrates evidence-based reporting standards, intelligent research tools and capacity-building resources. Built by a multidisciplinary consortium of clinical epidemiologists, acupuncture clinicians, implementation scientists and health-informatics experts, it serves researchers, practitioners, methodologists and journal editors worldwide.', '0', 205),
('about.s004', 'about', '关于我们', '我们做什么', 'What we do', '我们做什么', 'What we do', '0', 206),
('about.s005', 'about', '关于我们', '主持针刺报告规范', 'Stewardship of reporting guidelines', '主持针刺报告规范', 'Stewardship of reporting guidelines', '0', 207),
('about.s006', 'about', '关于我们', '主持针刺专属报告规范的制定、验证与迭代更新（CONSORT / STRICTA / SPIRIT / PRISMA / CARE / RIGHT / ARRIVE），遵循 EQUATOR 原则。', 'We lead the development, validation and iterative update of acupuncture-specific reporting standards (CONSORT / STRICTA / SPIRIT / PRISMA / CARE / RIGHT / ARRIVE), aligned with EQUATOR principles.', '主持针刺专属报告规范的制定、验证与迭代更新（CONSORT / STRICTA / SPIRIT / PRISMA / CARE / RIGHT / ARRIVE），遵循 EQUATOR 原则。', 'We lead the development, validation and iterative update of acupuncture-specific reporting standards (CONSORT / STRICTA / SPIRIT / PRISMA / CARE / RIGHT / ARRIVE), aligned with EQUATOR principles.', '0', 208),
('about.s007', 'about', '关于我们', '智能研究支持工具', 'Intelligent research tools', '智能研究支持工具', 'Intelligent research tools', '0', 209),
('about.s008', 'about', '关于我们', '研究类型匹配与报告模板、报告完整性自动校验，以及针刺适配的实施科学框架（CFIR / ERIC / RE-AIM）。', 'Study-type matching and report templates, automated completeness checking, and acupuncture-adapted implementation-science frameworks (CFIR / ERIC / RE-AIM).', '研究类型匹配与报告模板、报告完整性自动校验，以及针刺适配的实施科学框架（CFIR / ERIC / RE-AIM）。', 'Study-type matching and report templates, automated completeness checking, and acupuncture-adapted implementation-science frameworks (CFIR / ERIC / RE-AIM).', '0', 210),
('about.s009', 'about', '关于我们', '培训与能力建设', 'Training & capacity building', '培训与能力建设', 'Training & capacity building', '0', 211),
('about.s010', 'about', '关于我们', '规范解读教程、案例分析库与文献资源，并定期举办方法学工作坊与学术论坛，重点支持早期研究者。', 'Guideline-interpretation tutorials, a case-analysis library and curated literature, plus methodological workshops and academic forums for early-career researchers.', '规范解读教程、案例分析库与文献资源，并定期举办方法学工作坊与学术论坛，重点支持早期研究者。', 'Guideline-interpretation tutorials, a case-analysis library and curated literature, plus methodological workshops and academic forums for early-career researchers.', '0', 212),
('about.s011', 'about', '关于我们', '协作与专家咨询', 'Collaboration & consultation', '协作与专家咨询', 'Collaboration & consultation', '0', 213),
('about.s012', 'about', '关于我们', '开放的专家咨询通道与用户论坛，以及机构协作网络，分享最佳实践、持续改进规范与工具。', 'An open expert-consultation channel and user forum, plus an institutional collaboration network to share best practice and continuously improve our guidelines and tools.', '开放的专家咨询通道与用户论坛，以及机构协作网络，分享最佳实践、持续改进规范与工具。', 'An open expert-consultation channel and user forum, plus an institutional collaboration network to share best practice and continuously improve our guidelines and tools.', '0', 214),
('about.s013', 'about', '关于我们', '如何组织', 'How we are organised', '如何组织', 'How we are organised', '0', 215),
('about.s014', 'about', '关于我们', 'ACTION 由「国际顾问委员会 + 核心执行团队」两级组织架构治理，以保障平台的方法学严谨性、学术权威性与实践适用性，并引领针刺临床研究报告规范的长期发展。', 'ACTION is governed by a two-tier organisational structure — an International Advisory Board and a Core Execution Team — to safeguard the methodological rigour, academic authority and practical applicability of the platform, and to steer the long-term development of acupuncture clinical research reporting standards.', 'ACTION 由「国际顾问委员会 + 核心执行团队」两级组织架构治理，以保障平台的方法学严谨性、学术权威性与实践适用性，并引领针刺临床研究报告规范的长期发展。', 'ACTION is governed by a two-tier organisational structure — an International Advisory Board and a Core Execution Team — to safeguard the methodological rigour, academic authority and practical applicability of the platform, and to steer the long-term development of acupuncture clinical research reporting standards.', '0', 216),
('about.s015', 'about', '关于我们', '国际顾问委员会', 'International Advisory Board', '国际顾问委员会', 'International Advisory Board', '0', 217),
('about.s028', 'about', '关于我们', '核心执行团队', 'Core Execution Team', '核心执行团队', 'Core Execution Team', '0', 218),
('about.s037', 'about', '关于我们', '使命与愿景', 'Mission & Vision', '使命与愿景', 'Mission & Vision', '0', 219),
('about.s038', 'about', '关于我们', '我们为何存在，走向何方', 'Why ACTION exists, and where it is heading', '我们为何存在，走向何方', 'Why ACTION exists, and where it is heading', '0', 220),
('about.s039', 'about', '关于我们', '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" /><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" /><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" /></svg>使命', 'Mission', '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" /><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" /><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" /></svg>使命', 'Mission', '1', 221),
('about.s040', 'about', '关于我们', '赋能全球高质量、透明的针刺研究', 'Empowering high-quality, transparent acupuncture research worldwide', '赋能全球高质量、透明的针刺研究', 'Empowering high-quality, transparent acupuncture research worldwide', '0', 222),
('about.s041', 'about', '关于我们', '赋能全球针刺研究者与临床医师，通过标准化规范、实用智能工具与易得的方法学培训，设计、开展并报告高质量、透明、可复现、可转化的临床研究。我们致力于提升针刺临床证据的方法学质量，推动针刺医学的循证发展。', 'To empower acupuncture researchers and clinicians worldwide to design, conduct and report high-quality, transparent, reproducible and translatable clinical research, by providing standardised guidelines, practical intelligent tools and accessible methodological training. We are committed to elevating the methodological quality of acupuncture clinical evidence and advancing the evidence-based development of acupuncture medicine.', '赋能全球针刺研究者与临床医师，通过标准化规范、实用智能工具与易得的方法学培训，设计、开展并报告高质量、透明、可复现、可转化的临床研究。我们致力于提升针刺临床证据的方法学质量，推动针刺医学的循证发展。', 'To empower acupuncture researchers and clinicians worldwide to design, conduct and report high-quality, transparent, reproducible and translatable clinical research, by providing standardised guidelines, practical intelligent tools and accessible methodological training. We are committed to elevating the methodological quality of acupuncture clinical evidence and advancing the evidence-based development of acupuncture medicine.', '0', 223),
('about.s042', 'about', '关于我们', '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M2 12s3.5-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3.5 7-10 7-10-7-10-7Z" /><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" /></svg>愿景', 'Vision', '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M2 12s3.5-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3.5 7-10 7-10-7-10-7Z" /><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" /></svg>愿景', 'Vision', '1', 224),
('about.s043', 'about', '关于我们', '全球针刺研究方法学与报告规范的权威平台', 'The world’s leading platform for acupuncture research methodology', '全球针刺研究方法学与报告规范的权威平台', 'The world’s leading platform for acupuncture research methodology', '0', 225),
('about.s044', 'about', '关于我们', '成为全球针刺临床研究方法学与报告规范的权威平台；推动针刺研究的标准化、国际化与真实世界转化；为全球传统医学与公共卫生实践贡献稳健、高质量的证据。', 'To become the world’s leading authoritative platform for acupuncture clinical research methodology and reporting standards; to drive the standardisation, internationalisation and real-world translation of acupuncture research; and to contribute robust, high-quality evidence for global traditional medicine and public-health practice.', '成为全球针刺临床研究方法学与报告规范的权威平台；推动针刺研究的标准化、国际化与真实世界转化；为全球传统医学与公共卫生实践贡献稳健、高质量的证据。', 'To become the world’s leading authoritative platform for acupuncture clinical research methodology and reporting standards; to drive the standardisation, internationalisation and real-world translation of acupuncture research; and to contribute robust, high-quality evidence for global traditional medicine and public-health practice.', '0', 226),
('about.s045', 'about', '关于我们', '支持 ACTION', 'Support ACTION', '支持 ACTION', 'Support ACTION', '0', 227),
('about.s046', 'about', '关于我们', '如何支持 ACTION', 'How to support ACTION', '如何支持 ACTION', 'How to support ACTION', '0', 228),
('about.s047', 'about', '关于我们', 'ACTION 学术主导、非营利。研究者、机构与期刊可通过多种方式，共同提升针刺研究质量。', 'ACTION is academically led and non-profit. There are several ways researchers, institutions and journals can help raise the quality of acupuncture research.', 'ACTION 学术主导、非营利。研究者、机构与期刊可通过多种方式，共同提升针刺研究质量。', 'ACTION is academically led and non-profit. There are several ways researchers, institutions and journals can help raise the quality of acupuncture research.', '0', 229),
('about.s048', 'about', '关于我们', '采用并引用规范', 'Adopt & cite our guidelines', '采用并引用规范', 'Adopt & cite our guidelines', '0', 230),
('about.s049', 'about', '关于我们', '在研究设计、论文撰写与同行评审中采用并引用 ACTION 报告规范——广泛采用是提升研究质量最直接的方式。', 'Reference ACTION-endorsed reporting guidelines in study design, manuscript preparation and peer review. Widespread adoption is the most direct way to raise research quality.', '在研究设计、论文撰写与同行评审中采用并引用 ACTION 报告规范——广泛采用是提升研究质量最直接的方式。', 'Reference ACTION-endorsed reporting guidelines in study design, manuscript preparation and peer review. Widespread adoption is the most direct way to raise research quality.', '0', 231),
('about.s050', 'about', '关于我们', '参与制定与试点', 'Join development & pilot testing', '参与制定与试点', 'Join development & pilot testing', '0', 232),
('about.s051', 'about', '关于我们', '加入工作组，参与规范修订、验证研究与新工具试点——一线经验让规范真正适配真实研究。', 'Join our working groups for guideline revision, validation studies and pilot testing of new tools. Front-line experience makes guidelines fit for real-world research.', '加入工作组，参与规范修订、验证研究与新工具试点——一线经验让规范真正适配真实研究。', 'Join our working groups for guideline revision, validation studies and pilot testing of new tools. Front-line experience makes guidelines fit for real-world research.', '0', 233),
('about.s052', 'about', '关于我们', '反馈与贡献案例', 'Feedback & contribute cases', '反馈与贡献案例', 'Feedback & contribute cases', '0', 234),
('about.s053', 'about', '关于我们', '提交可用性、规范适用性与未满足需求的反馈，并向案例库贡献高质量针刺案例。', 'Submit feedback on usability, guideline applicability and unmet needs, and contribute high-quality acupuncture cases to the case library.', '提交可用性、规范适用性与未满足需求的反馈，并向案例库贡献高质量针刺案例。', 'Submit feedback on usability, guideline applicability and unmet needs, and contribute high-quality acupuncture cases to the case library.', '0', 235),
('about.s054', 'about', '关于我们', '机构合作与推广', 'Institutional collaboration', '机构合作与推广', 'Institutional collaboration', '0', 236),
('about.s055', 'about', '关于我们', '高校、医院、研究所与学会可建立正式合作、在机构内推广，并联合举办学术活动。', 'Universities, hospitals, institutes and societies can form formal partnerships, promote the platform internally and co-host academic activities.', '高校、医院、研究所与学会可建立正式合作、在机构内推广，并联合举办学术活动。', 'Universities, hospitals, institutes and societies can form formal partnerships, promote the platform internally and co-host academic activities.', '0', 237),
('about.s056', 'about', '关于我们', '支持我们的研究', 'Support our research', '支持我们的研究', 'Support our research', '0', 238),
('about.s057', 'about', '关于我们', '欢迎合作研究、经费支持与资源共享，共同推进新报告规范、智能工具与实施科学研究。', 'We welcome collaborative research, funding and resource sharing to advance new reporting standards, intelligent tools and implementation-science research.', '欢迎合作研究、经费支持与资源共享，共同推进新报告规范、智能工具与实施科学研究。', 'We welcome collaborative research, funding and resource sharing to advance new reporting standards, intelligent tools and implementation-science research.', '0', 239),
('about.s058', 'about', '关于我们', '参与进来 <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>', 'Get involved', '参与进来 <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>', 'Get involved', '1', 240),
('about.s059', 'about', '关于我们', '联系我们', 'Contact', '联系我们', 'Contact', '0', 241),
('about.s060', 'about', '关于我们', '与 ACTION 团队联系', 'Get in touch with the ACTION team', '与 ACTION 团队联系', 'Get in touch with the ACTION team', '0', 242),
