('about.s062', 'about', '关于我们', '规范咨询、工具试用、专家咨询、合作与媒体事宜均可来信。我们通常在 3–5 个工作日内回复。', 'For guideline queries, tool access, expert consultation, collaboration and media. We aim to reply within 3–5 working days.', '规范咨询、工具试用、专家咨询、合作与媒体事宜均可来信。我们通常在 3–5 个工作日内回复。', 'For guideline queries, tool access, expert consultation, collaboration and media. We aim to reply within 3–5 working days.', '0', 244),
