('about.s074', 'about', '关于我们', '学术与方法学声明', 'Academic & methodology statement', '学术与方法学声明', 'Academic & methodology statement', '0', 256),
('about.s075', 'about', '关于我们', 'ACTION 为学术主导、非营利平台。其报告规范依循 EQUATOR 网络方法学，通过结构化国际专家共识（含改良德尔菲流程）制定与验证。', 'ACTION is an academically led, non-profit platform. Its reporting guidelines are developed and validated under the methodology of the EQUATOR Network, through structured international expert consensus (including modified Delphi processes).', 'ACTION 为学术主导、非营利平台。其报告规范依循 EQUATOR 网络方法学，通过结构化国际专家共识（含改良德尔菲流程）制定与验证。', 'ACTION is an academically led, non-profit platform. Its reporting guidelines are developed and validated under the methodology of the EQUATOR Network, through structured international expert consensus (including modified Delphi processes).', '0', 257),
('about.s076', 'about', '关于我们', '平台智能工具（报告助手、SRD、CFIR / ERIC / RE-AIM）当前处于内测 / 演示阶段，其输出为辅助参考，不替代研究者、统计师的专业判断与同行评审。', 'The platform’s intelligent tools (reporting assistant, SRD, and CFIR / ERIC / RE-AIM) are currently in beta / demonstration. Their outputs are assistive references and do not replace the professional judgement of researchers, statisticians or peer review.', '平台智能工具（报告助手、SRD、CFIR / ERIC / RE-AIM）当前处于内测 / 演示阶段，其输出为辅助参考，不替代研究者、统计师的专业判断与同行评审。', 'The platform’s intelligent tools (reporting assistant, SRD, and CFIR / ERIC / RE-AIM) are currently in beta / demonstration. Their outputs are assistive references and do not replace the professional judgement of researchers, statisticians or peer review.', '0', 258),
('about.s077', 'about', '关于我们', '数据来源', 'Data sources', '数据来源', 'Data sources', '0', 259),
('about.s078', 'about', '关于我们', '报告规范条目来自已公开发表的国际报告规范及其针刺扩展（CONSORT / STRICTA / SPIRIT / PRISMA / CARE / RIGHT / ARRIVE）。', 'Guideline items derive from the published international reporting standards and their acupuncture extensions (CONSORT / STRICTA / SPIRIT / PRISMA / CARE / RIGHT / ARRIVE).', '报告规范条目来自已公开发表的国际报告规范及其针刺扩展（CONSORT / STRICTA / SPIRIT / PRISMA / CARE / RIGHT / ARRIVE）。', 'Guideline items derive from the published international reporting standards and their acupuncture extensions (CONSORT / STRICTA / SPIRIT / PRISMA / CARE / RIGHT / ARRIVE).', '0', 260),
('about.s079', 'about', '关于我们', '工具中的示例数据与文献引用来自公开发表文献，为演示功能之用。', 'Sample data and citations shown in the tools come from published literature and are illustrative, intended to demonstrate functionality.', '工具中的示例数据与文献引用来自公开发表文献，为演示功能之用。', 'Sample data and citations shown in the tools come from published literature and are illustrative, intended to demonstrate functionality.', '0', 261),
('about.s080', 'about', '关于我们', '机构名称、标识（logo）与外部链接归属各自组织，仅用于指引，不代表其对本平台的背书。', 'Institution names, logos and external links belong to their respective owners and are provided for reference; they do not imply endorsement of this platform.', '机构名称、标识（logo）与外部链接归属各自组织，仅用于指引，不代表其对本平台的背书。', 'Institution names, logos and external links belong to their respective owners and are provided for reference; they do not imply endorsement of this platform.', '0', 262),
('about.s081', 'about', '关于我们', '免责声明', 'Disclaimer', '免责声明', 'Disclaimer', '0', 263),
('about.s082', 'about', '关于我们', '本平台内容供学术研究与教育参考，不构成临床诊疗建议，亦不替代执业医师的判断。', 'Platform content is for academic and educational reference. It does not constitute clinical advice and does not replace the judgement of a licensed physician.', '本平台内容供学术研究与教育参考，不构成临床诊疗建议，亦不替代执业医师的判断。', 'Platform content is for academic and educational reference. It does not constitute clinical advice and does not replace the judgement of a licensed physician.', '0', 264),
('about.s083', 'about', '关于我们', 'AI 辅助功能可能产生不准确或不完整的输出，使用者须自行核验后使用；ACTION 不对因使用本平台内容产生的后果承担责任。', 'AI-assisted features may produce inaccurate or incomplete output. Users must verify results before use; ACTION accepts no liability for consequences arising from use of the content.', 'AI 辅助功能可能产生不准确或不完整的输出，使用者须自行核验后使用；ACTION 不对因使用本平台内容产生的后果承担责任。', 'AI-assisted features may produce inaccurate or incomplete output. Users must verify results before use; ACTION accepts no liability for consequences arising from use of the content.', '0', 265),
('about.s084', 'about', '关于我们', '外部链接指向的第三方内容由其各自所有者负责。', 'Third-party content reached through external links is the responsibility of its respective owners.', '外部链接指向的第三方内容由其各自所有者负责。', 'Third-party content reached through external links is the responsibility of its respective owners.', '0', 266),
('about.s085', 'about', '关于我们', '隐私政策与使用条款', 'Privacy policy & terms of use', '隐私政策与使用条款', 'Privacy policy & terms of use', '0', 267),
('about.s086', 'about', '关于我们', '数据处理：当前多数工具在你的浏览器本地运行并存储数据（如评估历史）；专家咨询请求通过邮件发送，仅用于回复你的咨询。', 'Data handling: most tools currently run and store data locally in your browser (e.g. assessment history); expert-consultation requests are sent by email and used only to reply to your enquiry.', '数据处理：当前多数工具在你的浏览器本地运行并存储数据（如评估历史）；专家咨询请求通过邮件发送，仅用于回复你的咨询。', 'Data handling: most tools currently run and store data locally in your browser (e.g. assessment history); expert-consultation requests are sent by email and used only to reply to your enquiry.', '0', 268),
('about.s087', 'about', '关于我们', 'Cookie 与统计：如启用访问统计，仅用于改进平台，不用于身份识别。', 'Cookies & analytics: any usage analytics are used solely to improve the platform and not for personal identification.', 'Cookie 与统计：如启用访问统计，仅用于改进平台，不用于身份识别。', 'Cookies & analytics: any usage analytics are used solely to improve the platform and not for personal identification.', '0', 269),
('about.s088', 'about', '关于我们', '知识产权：ACTION 制定的针刺扩展规范与平台内容著作权归 ACTION 及相应作者所有，非商业学术使用请注明出处。', 'Intellectual property: copyright of ACTION-developed acupuncture extensions and platform content belongs to ACTION and the respective authors; please cite the source for non-commercial academic use.', '知识产权：ACTION 制定的针刺扩展规范与平台内容著作权归 ACTION 及相应作者所有，非商业学术使用请注明出处。', 'Intellectual property: copyright of ACTION-developed acupuncture extensions and platform content belongs to ACTION and the respective authors; please cite the source for non-commercial academic use.', '0', 270),
('about.s089', 'about', '关于我们', '使用条款：请勿将平台用于违法用途或误导性宣传；平台内容可能更新，恕不另行通知。', 'Terms of use: do not use the platform for unlawful purposes or misleading promotion. Content may be updated without prior notice.', '使用条款：请勿将平台用于违法用途或误导性宣传；平台内容可能更新，恕不另行通知。', 'Terms of use: do not use the platform for unlawful purposes or misleading promotion. Content may be updated without prior notice.', '0', 271),
('about.s090', 'about', '关于我们', '最后更新：2026 年 7 月。对以上声明有疑问，请联系 action_acu{''@''}163.com。', 'Last updated: July 2026. For questions about these statements, contact action_acu{''@''}163.com.', '最后更新：2026 年 7 月。对以上声明有疑问，请联系 action_acu{''@''}163.com。', 'Last updated: July 2026. For questions about these statements, contact action_acu{''@''}163.com.', '0', 272),
