('about.hero.title', 'about', '关于我们', '学术主导的<span class="hl">针刺研究</span>方法学平台', 'An academically led home for <span class="hl">rigorous acupuncture research</span>', '学术主导的<span class="hl">针刺研究</span>方法学平台', 'An academically led home for <span class="hl">rigorous acupuncture research</span>', '1', 277),
('about.hero.sub', 'about', '关于我们', 'ACTION（ACupuncTure Intelligent helper ON clinical research）是学术主导、非营利的智能平台，致力于提升针刺临床研究的质量、透明度、可复现性与转化落地——由多学科联合体建设，国际顾问委员会指导。', 'ACTION (ACupuncTure Intelligent helper ON clinical research) is a non-profit intelligent platform advancing the quality, transparency, reproducibility and translation of acupuncture clinical research, built by a multidisciplinary consortium and guided by an international advisory board.', 'ACTION（ACupuncTure Intelligent helper ON clinical research）是学术主导、非营利的智能平台，致力于提升针刺临床研究的质量、透明度、可复现性与转化落地——由多学科联合体建设，国际顾问委员会指导。', 'ACTION (ACupuncTure Intelligent helper ON clinical research) is a non-profit intelligent platform advancing the quality, transparency, reproducibility and translation of acupuncture clinical research, built by a multidisciplinary consortium and guided by an international advisory board.', '0', 278),
