('assistant.s014', 'assistant', '报告助手', '用 2–3 个极简选择题，系统自动判定你的研究类型，<b>自动挂载对应报告规范</b>并推荐合适的统计学方法。', 'Answer two or three quick questions. The tool determines your study type, auto-mounts the right reporting guidelines and recommends the appropriate statistical methods.', '用 2–3 个极简选择题，系统自动判定你的研究类型，<b>自动挂载对应报告规范</b>并推荐合适的统计学方法。', 'Answer two or three quick questions. The tool determines your study type, auto-mounts the right reporting guidelines and recommends the appropriate statistical methods.', '1', 306),
