('assistant.s029', 'assistant', '报告助手', '在线报告模板', 'Online reporting template', '在线报告模板', 'Online reporting template', '0', 328),
('assistant.s030', 'assistant', '报告助手', '依据第一步匹配到的规范，自动展开该规范的<b>全部 checklist 条目</b>；一份规范含多张清单表时（如 RCT = CONSORT 主表 + 摘要表 + STRICTA 表）已合并为一条流水清单。条目即投稿时随稿提交的那份表，逐条填写后可一键合成报告初稿。', 'The full <b>checklist</b> of the guideline matched in step 1 is expanded automatically. Where a guideline spans several tables (an RCT covers the CONSORT main table, the abstract table and STRICTA), they are merged into one sequence. These are the very items journals ask you to submit alongside the manuscript; answer them one by one and the draft report is composed in one click.', '依据第一步匹配到的规范，自动展开该规范的<b>全部 checklist 条目</b>；一份规范含多张清单表时（如 RCT = CONSORT 主表 + 摘要表 + STRICTA 表）已合并为一条流水清单。条目即投稿时随稿提交的那份表，逐条填写后可一键合成报告初稿。', 'The full <b>checklist</b> of the guideline matched in step 1 is expanded automatically. Where a guideline spans several tables (an RCT covers the CONSORT main table, the abstract table and STRICTA), they are merged into one sequence. These are the very items journals ask you to submit alongside the manuscript; answer them one by one and the draft report is composed in one click.', '1', 329),
('assistant.s048', 'assistant', '报告助手', '<b>数据联动（规划中）。</b>后续将支持导入课题组既往基线表或 Excel 原始数据，自动填入模板的结果部分。', '<b>Data linkage (planned).</b> Importing an existing baseline table or raw Excel data to auto-fill the results section is on the roadmap.', '<b>数据联动（规划中）。</b>后续将支持导入课题组既往基线表或 Excel 原始数据，自动填入模板的结果部分。', '<b>Data linkage (planned).</b> Importing an existing baseline table or raw Excel data to auto-fill the results section is on the roadmap.', '1', 330),
('assistant.s058', 'assistant', '报告助手', '第三步', 'Step 3', '第三步', 'Step 3', '0', 331),
('assistant.s059', 'assistant', '报告助手', '报告内容智能校验', 'Intelligent content validation', '报告内容智能校验', 'Intelligent content validation', '0', 332),
('assistant.s060', 'assistant', '报告助手', '把稿件交给平台逐条核对：每行编号后，按第二步展开的 checklist 逐条判定<b>已报告 / 描述模糊 / 未报告</b>，已报告的回填行号与原文片段，未报告的说明该补什么——投稿时随稿提交的那份表，到这一步就填好了。逐条之外再通读一遍全稿，交叉核对<b>针灸逻辑一致性与术语标准化</b>。', 'Hand the manuscript over for an item-by-item check: every line is numbered, then each checklist item from step 2 is judged <b>reported / vague / not reported</b> — with line numbers and the quoted evidence where it is reported, and what to add where it is not. That is the table journals ask you to submit, filled in. The whole manuscript is then read once more to cross-check <b>acupuncture logic and terminology</b>.', '把稿件交给平台逐条核对：每行编号后，按第二步展开的 checklist 逐条判定<b>已报告 / 描述模糊 / 未报告</b>，已报告的回填行号与原文片段，未报告的说明该补什么——投稿时随稿提交的那份表，到这一步就填好了。逐条之外再通读一遍全稿，交叉核对<b>针灸逻辑一致性与术语标准化</b>。', 'Hand the manuscript over for an item-by-item check: every line is numbered, then each checklist item from step 2 is judged <b>reported / vague / not reported</b> — with line numbers and the quoted evidence where it is reported, and what to add where it is not. That is the table journals ask you to submit, filled in. The whole manuscript is then read once more to cross-check <b>acupuncture logic and terminology</b>.', '1', 333),
('assistant.s061', 'assistant', '报告助手', '报告完整性', 'Completeness', '报告完整性', 'Completeness', '0', 334),
('assistant.rvTitle', 'assistant', '报告助手', '提交你的稿件', 'Submit your manuscript', '提交你的稿件', 'Submit your manuscript', '0', 335),
('assistant.rvHint', 'assistant', '报告助手', '把稿件正文粘贴到这里（正文即可，不必带参考文献）。系统会给每一行编号，逐条核对第二步展开的 checklist，并回填「报告于第几行」或「未报告的原因」。稿件与判定结果会保存在你的账号下，供你在下方「校验历史」里回看；删除记录时稿件正文会一并清除。', 'Paste the body of your manuscript here (references are not needed). Every line is numbered, then checked item by item against the checklist expanded in step 2, filling in “reported on line N” or the reason it is missing. The manuscript and its results are saved under your account so you can reopen them from “Check history” below; deleting a record also erases the manuscript.', '把稿件正文粘贴到这里（正文即可，不必带参考文献）。系统会给每一行编号，逐条核对第二步展开的 checklist，并回填「报告于第几行」或「未报告的原因」。稿件与判定结果会保存在你的账号下，供你在下方「校验历史」里回看；删除记录时稿件正文会一并清除。', 'Paste the body of your manuscript here (references are not needed). Every line is numbered, then checked item by item against the checklist expanded in step 2, filling in “reported on line N” or the reason it is missing. The manuscript and its results are saved under your account so you can reopen them from “Check history” below; deleting a record also erases the manuscript.', '0', 336),
