('assistant.rvHistDesc', 'assistant', '报告助手', '每次提交都会留下一条记录，关掉页面或刷新之后仍可在这里点开回看，跑失败的也在。删除会连同稿件正文一并清除。', 'Every submission leaves a record here, so you can reopen a result after closing or refreshing the page — failed runs included. Deleting a record also erases the stored manuscript.', '每次提交都会留下一条记录，关掉页面或刷新之后仍可在这里点开回看，跑失败的也在。删除会连同稿件正文一并清除。', 'Every submission leaves a record here, so you can reopen a result after closing or refreshing the page — failed runs included. Deleting a record also erases the stored manuscript.', '0', 360),
