('assistant.ckTitle', 'assistant', '报告助手', '针灸逻辑与术语校验', 'Acupuncture logic & terminology checks', '针灸逻辑与术语校验', 'Acupuncture logic & terminology checks', '0', 372),
('assistant.ckDesc', 'assistant', '报告助手', '逐条核对之外，再通读全稿交叉核对四件事：干预与对照有没有写混、针刺频次与随访时点前后是否矛盾、样本量依据与实际纳入例数是否匹配、穴位名称是否用了标准写法。这一层只指路、不改稿，结论请人工复核。', 'Beyond the item-by-item check, the whole manuscript is read once more to cross-check four things: whether the intervention and the control arm have been mixed up, whether needling frequency and follow-up time points contradict each other, whether the sample-size calculation matches the number actually enrolled, and whether acupoint names follow the standard convention. This layer points at problems rather than fixing them — please verify each finding yourself.', '逐条核对之外，再通读全稿交叉核对四件事：干预与对照有没有写混、针刺频次与随访时点前后是否矛盾、样本量依据与实际纳入例数是否匹配、穴位名称是否用了标准写法。这一层只指路、不改稿，结论请人工复核。', 'Beyond the item-by-item check, the whole manuscript is read once more to cross-check four things: whether the intervention and the control arm have been mixed up, whether needling frequency and follow-up time points contradict each other, whether the sample-size calculation matches the number actually enrolled, and whether acupoint names follow the standard convention. This layer points at problems rather than fixing them — please verify each finding yourself.', '0', 373),
('assistant.ckRule.arm', 'assistant', '报告助手', '干预措施与对照组描述是否混淆', 'Intervention and control arm confused with each other', '干预措施与对照组描述是否混淆', 'Intervention and control arm confused with each other', '0', 374),
