('assistant.ckEmpty.unchecked', 'assistant', '报告助手', '这项检查没有跑完（模型调用失败）。既不代表有问题，也不代表没问题，请人工核对。', 'This check did not finish (the model call failed). It means neither that there is a problem nor that there is none — please verify manually.', '这项检查没有跑完（模型调用失败）。既不代表有问题，也不代表没问题，请人工核对。', 'This check did not finish (the model call failed). It means neither that there is a problem nor that there is none — please verify manually.', '0', 387),
