('assistant.ckTruncated', 'assistant', '报告助手', '稿件超出全稿校验的通读上限，仅通读了前一部分；后半段未参与交叉核对。', 'The manuscript exceeds the reading budget for whole-manuscript checks. Only the first part was read; the remainder was not cross-checked.', '稿件超出全稿校验的通读上限，仅通读了前一部分；后半段未参与交叉核对。', 'The manuscript exceeds the reading budget for whole-manuscript checks. Only the first part was read; the remainder was not cross-checked.', '0', 390),
