('assistant.s087', 'assistant', '报告助手', '给报告文字做续写、润色与中译英。**直接用就行**：填几个关键词或粘一段正文即可，不必先建草稿、也不必先跑校验。若你在第二步填过草稿并跑过第三步，下方还会额外列出判为「描述模糊 / 未报告」的条目，改完可一键写回对应条目。', 'Draft, polish and translate report prose. **Usable on its own** — just give a few keywords or paste a passage; no draft and no prior check required. If you did fill in a draft in step 2 and ran step 3, the items judged “vague” or “not reported” are also listed below, and your edits can be written straight back to them.', '给报告文字做续写、润色与中译英。**直接用就行**：填几个关键词或粘一段正文即可，不必先建草稿、也不必先跑校验。若你在第二步填过草稿并跑过第三步，下方还会额外列出判为「描述模糊 / 未报告」的条目，改完可一键写回对应条目。', 'Draft, polish and translate report prose. **Usable on its own** — just give a few keywords or paste a passage; no draft and no prior check required. If you did fill in a draft in step 2 and ran step 3, the items judged “vague” or “not reported” are also listed below, and your edits can be written straight back to them.', '0', 394),
