('assistant._title', 'assistant', '报告助手', '报告助手 {''|''} ACTION · 针刺临床研究报告全流程智能辅助', 'Reporting assistant {''|''} ACTION · End-to-end support for acupuncture research reporting', '报告助手 {''|''} ACTION · 针刺临床研究报告全流程智能辅助', 'Reporting assistant {''|''} ACTION · End-to-end support for acupuncture research reporting', '0', 412),
('assistant._desc', 'assistant', '报告助手', 'ACTION 报告助手：五步阶梯式向导——研究类型智能匹配、在线报告模板、报告内容智能校验、AI 辅助撰写建议、报告导出与分享，覆盖针刺临床研究报告全流程。', 'The ACTION reporting assistant: a five-step guided workflow — study-type matching, online reporting templates, completeness checking, AI-assisted drafting suggestions, and export and sharing — covering the whole acupuncture clinical research reporting process.', 'ACTION 报告助手：五步阶梯式向导——研究类型智能匹配、在线报告模板、报告内容智能校验、AI 辅助撰写建议、报告导出与分享，覆盖针刺临床研究报告全流程。', 'The ACTION reporting assistant: a five-step guided workflow — study-type matching, online reporting templates, completeness checking, AI-assisted drafting suggestions, and export and sharing — covering the whole acupuncture clinical research reporting process.', '0', 413),
