('assistant.shamNoteY', 'assistant', '报告助手', '设假针 / 安慰针对照：请重点报告 STRICTA 第 6 领域「对照措施」，说明假针的选穴、深度与是否通电。', 'Sham / placebo-needle control: report STRICTA domain 6 (the control intervention) in full — sham point selection, depth, and whether current is delivered.', '设假针 / 安慰针对照：请重点报告 STRICTA 第 6 领域「对照措施」，说明假针的选穴、深度与是否通电。', 'Sham / placebo-needle control: report STRICTA domain 6 (the control intervention) in full — sham point selection, depth, and whether current is delivered.', '0', 421),
('assistant.shamNoteN', 'assistant', '报告助手', '未设假针对照：请说明对照类型（等待治疗 / 常规治疗 / 阳性对照），并在讨论中报告未设盲带来的局限。', 'No sham control: state the comparator used (waiting list / usual care / active control) and discuss the limitations of leaving participants unblinded.', '未设假针对照：请说明对照类型（等待治疗 / 常规治疗 / 阳性对照），并在讨论中报告未设盲带来的局限。', 'No sham control: state the comparator used (waiting list / usual care / active control) and discuss the limitations of leaving participants unblinded.', '0', 422),
