('assistant.skipHint', 'assistant', '报告助手', '你选的是「已经有稿件了」。这一步的逐条模板是给从零开始写的人用的——想看看清单长什么样可以留下，要校验稿件直接去第 3 步。', 'You chose “I already have a manuscript”. The item-by-item template here is for writing from scratch — stay if you want to see what the checklist looks like, or go straight to step 3 to have your manuscript checked.', '你选的是「已经有稿件了」。这一步的逐条模板是给从零开始写的人用的——想看看清单长什么样可以留下，要校验稿件直接去第 3 步。', 'You chose “I already have a manuscript”. The item-by-item template here is for writing from scratch — stay if you want to see what the checklist looks like, or go straight to step 3 to have your manuscript checked.', '0', 483),
('assistant.skipToReview', 'assistant', '报告助手', '跳到第 3 步', 'Skip to step 3', '跳到第 3 步', 'Skip to step 3', '0', 484),
('assistant.rvFromDraft', 'assistant', '报告助手', '这份稿件来自第 2 步的初稿。你已经对着 checklist 逐条填过一遍，所以<b>完整性多半是满的</b>——这一步真正值得看的是被判为<b>描述模糊</b>的条目，以及下方的<b>逻辑一致性与术语标准化</b>。', 'This manuscript came from the draft generated in step 2. You already answered the checklist item by item, so <b>completeness will mostly come back full</b> — what is worth reading here are the items judged <b>vague</b>, and the <b>logic and terminology cross-check</b> below.', '这份稿件来自第 2 步的初稿。你已经对着 checklist 逐条填过一遍，所以<b>完整性多半是满的</b>——这一步真正值得看的是被判为<b>描述模糊</b>的条目，以及下方的<b>逻辑一致性与术语标准化</b>。', 'This manuscript came from the draft generated in step 2. You already answered the checklist item by item, so <b>completeness will mostly come back full</b> — what is worth reading here are the items judged <b>vague</b>, and the <b>logic and terminology cross-check</b> below.', '1', 485),
('assistant.wkNeedLogin', 'assistant', '报告助手', '第四步改的是你自己的报告草稿，需要先登录。', 'This step edits your own draft report, so please sign in first.', '第四步改的是你自己的报告草稿，需要先登录。', 'This step edits your own draft report, so please sign in first.', '0', 486),
('assistant.wkNeedDraft', 'assistant', '报告助手', '你还没有草稿。上面的功能照常可用；若在第二步对着 checklist 填几条，这里会额外多出一张「哪几条待改」的清单。', 'You have no draft yet. Everything above works regardless; fill in a few checklist items in step 2 and a list of “what still needs work” will appear here as well.', '你还没有草稿。上面的功能照常可用；若在第二步对着 checklist 填几条，这里会额外多出一张「哪几条待改」的清单。', 'You have no draft yet. Everything above works regardless; fill in a few checklist items in step 2 and a list of “what still needs work” will appear here as well.', '0', 487),
('assistant.wkNeedReview', 'assistant', '报告助手', '这份草稿还没跑过校验。上面的功能照常可用；跑完第三步，需要改的条目会额外列到这里，改完可一键写回。', 'This draft has not been checked yet. Everything above works regardless; once step 3 finishes, the items needing work are also listed here and can be written straight back.', '这份草稿还没跑过校验。上面的功能照常可用；跑完第三步，需要改的条目会额外列到这里，改完可一键写回。', 'This draft has not been checked yet. Everything above works regardless; once step 3 finishes, the items needing work are also listed here and can be written straight back.', '0', 488),
