('assistant.wkSoloLead.translate', 'assistant', '报告助手', '把要投稿国际期刊的中文正文贴在下面，译成学术英文。术语用国际针刺研究文献的通行译法。', 'Paste the Chinese passage below to get publication-ready academic English, using the terminology conventional in international acupuncture research.', '把要投稿国际期刊的中文正文贴在下面，译成学术英文。术语用国际针刺研究文献的通行译法。', 'Paste the Chinese passage below to get publication-ready academic English, using the terminology conventional in international acupuncture research.', '0', 511),
