('assistant.wkNote', 'assistant', '报告助手', '模型<b>不会编造研究数据</b>：样本量、p 值、随访时长等没给出的信息一律留成「【待补充】」占位，不会替你猜一个。生成结果请务必自行核对后再采用。', 'The model <b>never fabricates study data</b>: sample sizes, p values, follow-up durations and anything else not supplied are left as “[to be completed]” placeholders rather than guessed. Always verify a suggestion before applying it.', '模型<b>不会编造研究数据</b>：样本量、p 值、随访时长等没给出的信息一律留成「【待补充】」占位，不会替你猜一个。生成结果请务必自行核对后再采用。', 'The model <b>never fabricates study data</b>: sample sizes, p values, follow-up durations and anything else not supplied are left as “[to be completed]” placeholders rather than guessed. Always verify a suggestion before applying it.', '1', 537),
