('assistant.expDesc.xlsx', 'assistant', '报告助手', '投稿时随稿提交的那份 checklist 对照表，带校验判定', 'The checklist journals ask you to submit alongside the manuscript, with check results', '投稿时随稿提交的那份 checklist 对照表，带校验判定', 'The checklist journals ask you to submit alongside the manuscript, with check results', '0', 542),
