('assistant.expRunning', 'assistant', '报告助手', '正在生成…', 'Generating…', '正在生成…', 'Generating…', '0', 544),
('assistant.expNote', 'assistant', '报告助手', '未填写的<b>必填</b>条目会在稿件里留下「【待补充：条目 x】」标记，方便你对着改；选填条目不留痕迹。<b>不提供 PDF</b> —— 服务端生成中文 PDF 依赖服务器上的中文字体，缺字体时是整篇方块字而不是报错，用 Word 自己另存更可靠。', 'Unanswered <b>required</b> items are marked “[To be completed: item x]” in the manuscript so you can find them; conditional items leave no trace. <b>No PDF</b> — server-side Chinese PDF generation depends on fonts installed on the server, and a missing font renders as tofu blocks rather than an error. Save to PDF from Word instead.', '未填写的<b>必填</b>条目会在稿件里留下「【待补充：条目 x】」标记，方便你对着改；选填条目不留痕迹。<b>不提供 PDF</b> —— 服务端生成中文 PDF 依赖服务器上的中文字体，缺字体时是整篇方块字而不是报错，用 Word 自己另存更可靠。', 'Unanswered <b>required</b> items are marked “[To be completed: item x]” in the manuscript so you can find them; conditional items leave no trace. <b>No PDF</b> — server-side Chinese PDF generation depends on fonts installed on the server, and a missing font renders as tofu blocks rather than an error. Save to PDF from Word instead.', '1', 545),
('assistant.auditApplied', 'assistant', '报告助手', '采纳 AI 改写，写回条目 {no}（{chars} 字符）', 'Applied an AI rewrite to item {no} ({chars} characters)', '采纳 AI 改写，写回条目 {no}（{chars} 字符）', 'Applied an AI rewrite to item {no} ({chars} characters)', '0', 546),
