('collaborate.s015', 'collaborate', '协作与联系', '<b>由 ACTION 国际顾问委员会与执行团队共同评审合作申请。</b>汇聚中韩针刺研究、循证医学、方法学与实施科学领域专家，共同推动全球针刺科研标准化发展。', '<b>All applications are reviewed by the ACTION International Advisory Committee and Executive Team.</b> Experts from China and the Republic of Korea specialising in acupuncture research, evidence-based medicine, methodology and implementation science work together to advance standardised global acupuncture research.', '<b>由 ACTION 国际顾问委员会与执行团队共同评审合作申请。</b>汇聚中韩针刺研究、循证医学、方法学与实施科学领域专家，共同推动全球针刺科研标准化发展。', '<b>All applications are reviewed by the ACTION International Advisory Committee and Executive Team.</b> Experts from China and the Republic of Korea specialising in acupuncture research, evidence-based medicine, methodology and implementation science work together to advance standardised global acupuncture research.', '1', 562),
