('guidelines.s041', 'guidelines', '报告规范目录', '点开任一套规范，查看适用范围与条目清单，下载中文或英文文档，或打开原文查看完整的说明与阐释。中英文档同为一等公民。', 'Open a set to read its scope and checklist, download the Chinese or English document, or open the source article for the full explanation and elaboration. Documents are provided on equal footing in both languages.', '点开任一套规范，查看适用范围与条目清单，下载中文或英文文档，或打开原文查看完整的说明与阐释。中英文档同为一等公民。', 'Open a set to read its scope and checklist, download the Chinese or English document, or open the source article for the full explanation and elaboration. Documents are provided on equal footing in both languages.', '0', 696),
