('guidelines.s076', 'guidelines', '报告规范目录', 'CARE for Acupuncture 将 CARE（病例报告）声明扩展至针刺病例报告与病例系列。它依循 EQUATOR 方法学、由国际多学科专家组制定，补齐了通用病例报告规范所缺失的针刺细节：针具类型、选穴与操作、辨证分型、得气与不良事件。', 'CARE for Acupuncture extends the CARE (CAse REport) statement to acupuncture case reports and case series. Developed under the EQUATOR methodology by an international, multidisciplinary panel, it adds the acupuncture-specific detail that generic case-report guidance omits — needle type, point selection and operation, syndrome differentiation, de qi, and adverse events.', 'CARE for Acupuncture 将 CARE（病例报告）声明扩展至针刺病例报告与病例系列。它依循 EQUATOR 方法学、由国际多学科专家组制定，补齐了通用病例报告规范所缺失的针刺细节：针具类型、选穴与操作、辨证分型、得气与不良事件。', 'CARE for Acupuncture extends the CARE (CAse REport) statement to acupuncture case reports and case series. Developed under the EQUATOR methodology by an international, multidisciplinary panel, it adds the acupuncture-specific detail that generic case-report guidance omits — needle type, point selection and operation, syndrome differentiation, de qi, and adverse events.', '0', 731),
