('guidelines.s118', 'guidelines', '报告规范目录', '报告规范是持续演进的活文档。ACTION 记录每一套规范的当前版本、注册与发表状态，以及更新承诺，让你始终引用真正使用的那一版。', 'Reporting guidelines are living documents. ACTION records each set''s current version, registration and publication status, and its update commitment — so you always cite the version you actually used.', '报告规范是持续演进的活文档。ACTION 记录每一套规范的当前版本、注册与发表状态，以及更新承诺，让你始终引用真正使用的那一版。', 'Reporting guidelines are living documents. ACTION records each set''s current version, registration and publication status, and its update commitment — so you always cite the version you actually used.', '0', 773),
