('guidelines.s154', 'guidelines', '报告规范目录', '<b>关于版本。</b>ACTION 依循 EQUATOR 网络方法学主持并迭代针刺扩展规范（如 CARE for Acupuncture）；对外部声明（CONSORT、SPIRIT、PRISMA、RIGHT、ARRIVE）的扩展随其上游版本演进。请始终引用你研究中实际使用的确切版本。', '<b>On versioning.</b> ACTION hosts and iterates the acupuncture extensions (CARE for Acupuncture and others) under the EQUATOR network''s methodology; extensions of external statements (CONSORT, SPIRIT, PRISMA, RIGHT, ARRIVE) track their upstream versions. Always cite the exact version used in your study.', '<b>关于版本。</b>ACTION 依循 EQUATOR 网络方法学主持并迭代针刺扩展规范（如 CARE for Acupuncture）；对外部声明（CONSORT、SPIRIT、PRISMA、RIGHT、ARRIVE）的扩展随其上游版本演进。请始终引用你研究中实际使用的确切版本。', '<b>On versioning.</b> ACTION hosts and iterates the acupuncture extensions (CARE for Acupuncture and others) under the EQUATOR network''s methodology; extensions of external statements (CONSORT, SPIRIT, PRISMA, RIGHT, ARRIVE) track their upstream versions. Always cite the exact version used in your study.', '1', 809),
('guidelines.s155', 'guidelines', '报告规范目录', '④ 试点测试', '④ Pilot testing', '④ 试点测试', '④ Pilot testing', '0', 810),
('guidelines.s156', 'guidelines', '报告规范目录', 'CARE for Acupuncture 的共识与试点检验', 'How CARE for Acupuncture was tested', 'CARE for Acupuncture 的共识与试点检验', 'How CARE for Acupuncture was tested', '0', 811),
('guidelines.s157', 'guidelines', '报告规范目录', '在正式发布前，CARE for Acupuncture 条目清单通过一套结构化的国际专家共识流程完成试点检验——最终条目反映的是经检验的共识，而非单一小组的意见。', 'Before release, the CARE for Acupuncture checklist was pilot-tested through a structured, international expert-consensus process — so the final items reflect tested agreement, not a single group''s opinion.', '在正式发布前，CARE for Acupuncture 条目清单通过一套结构化的国际专家共识流程完成试点检验——最终条目反映的是经检验的共识，而非单一小组的意见。', 'Before release, the CARE for Acupuncture checklist was pilot-tested through a structured, international expert-consensus process — so the final items reflect tested agreement, not a single group''s opinion.', '0', 812),
('guidelines.s158', 'guidelines', '报告规范目录', '由临床医生、研究者、方法学家与期刊编辑组成的国际多学科专家组，依循 EQUATOR 网络推荐方法，通过三轮改良德尔菲（Delphi）调查，对初始 31 个条目逐轮打磨。共识度 ≥80% 的条目保留，50–80% 的修订，低于 50% 的剔除。最终剔除 1 项（诊断挑战），形成 13 领域、30 条目的定稿清单。', 'An international, multidisciplinary panel — clinicians, researchers, methodologists and journal editors — refined an initial 31-item checklist through three rounds of modified Delphi surveys, following the EQUATOR network''s recommended method. Items reaching ≥80% consensus were retained; those between 50–80% were revised; below 50% were excluded. One item (diagnostic challenges) was dropped, yielding a final checklist of 13 domains and 30 items.', '由临床医生、研究者、方法学家与期刊编辑组成的国际多学科专家组，依循 EQUATOR 网络推荐方法，通过三轮改良德尔菲（Delphi）调查，对初始 31 个条目逐轮打磨。共识度 ≥80% 的条目保留，50–80% 的修订，低于 50% 的剔除。最终剔除 1 项（诊断挑战），形成 13 领域、30 条目的定稿清单。', 'An international, multidisciplinary panel — clinicians, researchers, methodologists and journal editors — refined an initial 31-item checklist through three rounds of modified Delphi surveys, following the EQUATOR network''s recommended method. Items reaching ≥80% consensus were retained; those between 50–80% were revised; below 50% were excluded. One item (diagnostic challenges) was dropped, yielding a final checklist of 13 domains and 30 items.', '0', 813),
('guidelines.s159', 'guidelines', '报告规范目录', '敏感性分析与一致性评价得到 Kendall 和谐系数 0.163（p&lt;0.001）、变异系数 15.1%，表明清单具有良好的稳定性与内部一致性。', 'A sensitivity analysis and consistency evaluation gave a Kendall''s coefficient of concordance of 0.163 (p<0.001) and a coefficient of variation of 15.1%, indicating good stability and internal consistency.', '敏感性分析与一致性评价得到 Kendall 和谐系数 0.163（p&lt;0.001）、变异系数 15.1%，表明清单具有良好的稳定性与内部一致性。', 'A sensitivity analysis and consistency evaluation gave a Kendall''s coefficient of concordance of 0.163 (p<0.001) and a coefficient of variation of 15.1%, indicating good stability and internal consistency.', '1', 814),
