('guidelines.s172', 'guidelines', '报告规范目录', '<b>数据来源。</b>Duan Y, Xu Z, Zhang Y, 等. CARE extension guideline for acupuncture case reports. <i>BMJ Evidence-Based Medicine</i>, 2025. doi:10.1136/bmjebm-2025-113641。以上数据取自该已发表的共识研究。', '<b>Source.</b> Duan Y, Xu Z, Zhang Y, et al. CARE extension guideline for acupuncture case reports. <i>BMJ Evidence-Based Medicine</i>, 2025. doi:10.1136/bmjebm-2025-113641. Figures above are drawn from the published consensus study.', '<b>数据来源。</b>Duan Y, Xu Z, Zhang Y, 等. CARE extension guideline for acupuncture case reports. <i>BMJ Evidence-Based Medicine</i>, 2025. doi:10.1136/bmjebm-2025-113641。以上数据取自该已发表的共识研究。', '<b>Source.</b> Duan Y, Xu Z, Zhang Y, et al. CARE extension guideline for acupuncture case reports. <i>BMJ Evidence-Based Medicine</i>, 2025. doi:10.1136/bmjebm-2025-113641. Figures above are drawn from the published consensus study.', '1', 827),
