('implementation.s001', 'implementation', '实施性研究', '针刺适配框架 · CFIR', 'Acupuncture-adapted · CFIR', '针刺适配框架 · CFIR', 'Acupuncture-adapted · CFIR', '0', 846),
('implementation.s002', 'implementation', '实施性研究', 'CFIR 针刺智能评估与优化工具', 'CFIR intelligent assessment & optimisation', 'CFIR 针刺智能评估与优化工具', 'CFIR intelligent assessment & optimisation', '0', 847),
('implementation.s003', 'implementation', '实施性研究', '基于针刺适配版 CFIR（实施研究综合框架）的五大领域构建。两种用法：将障碍直接对应到已整理的策略对照库，或由 AI 从你的情境描述中梳理障碍、再从策略库调取候选方案。两种方式都产出一份「障碍—策略」优化建议报告。', 'Built on an acupuncture-adapted CFIR (Consolidated Framework for Implementation Research) with five domains. Two ways to work: match barriers to pre-curated strategies directly, or let AI distil barriers from your description and pull candidate strategies from the library. Either way you get a barrier–strategy optimisation report.', '基于针刺适配版 CFIR（实施研究综合框架）的五大领域构建。两种用法：将障碍直接对应到已整理的策略对照库，或由 AI 从你的情境描述中梳理障碍、再从策略库调取候选方案。两种方式都产出一份「障碍—策略」优化建议报告。', 'Built on an acupuncture-adapted CFIR (Consolidated Framework for Implementation Research) with five domains. Two ways to work: match barriers to pre-curated strategies directly, or let AI distil barriers from your description and pull candidate strategies from the library. Either way you get a barrier–strategy optimisation report.', '0', 848),
('implementation.s004', 'implementation', '实施性研究', '对照库匹配', 'Match from library', '对照库匹配', 'Match from library', '0', 849),
('implementation.s005', 'implementation', '实施性研究', 'AI 智能梳理', 'AI distils barriers', 'AI 智能梳理', 'AI distils barriers', '0', 850),
('implementation.s006', 'implementation', '实施性研究', '在下列构念中勾选你所在情境中构成<b>障碍</b>的条目。每个障碍都已对应到策略<b>对照库</b>中经整理的实施策略，直接生成「障碍—策略」报告。', 'Tick the constructs that are barriers in your setting. Each maps to <b>pre-curated implementation strategies</b> in the reference library, producing a barrier–strategy report directly.', '在下列构念中勾选你所在情境中构成<b>障碍</b>的条目。每个障碍都已对应到策略<b>对照库</b>中经整理的实施策略，直接生成「障碍—策略」报告。', 'Tick the constructs that are barriers in your setting. Each maps to <b>pre-curated implementation strategies</b> in the reference library, producing a barrier–strategy report directly.', '1', 851),
