('implementation.s011', 'implementation', '实施性研究', '用一段话描述你的针刺实施情境与遇到的困难。AI 会梳理出背后对应的 CFIR 障碍，并从策略库调取可供选择的候选方案。', 'Describe your acupuncture implementation setting and the difficulties you face. The AI distils the underlying CFIR barriers, then pulls candidate strategies from the library for you to choose from.', '用一段话描述你的针刺实施情境与遇到的困难。AI 会梳理出背后对应的 CFIR 障碍，并从策略库调取可供选择的候选方案。', 'Describe your acupuncture implementation setting and the difficulties you face. The AI distils the underlying CFIR barriers, then pulls candidate strategies from the library for you to choose from.', '0', 856),
