('implementation.s015', 'implementation', '实施性研究', '勾选障碍（或描述情境）后生成，「障碍—策略」报告将显示在此，可导出 CSV。', 'Select barriers (or describe your scenario) and generate. The barrier–strategy report appears here, exportable as CSV.', '勾选障碍（或描述情境）后生成，「障碍—策略」报告将显示在此，可导出 CSV。', 'Select barriers (or describe your scenario) and generate. The barrier–strategy report appears here, exportable as CSV.', '0', 860),
('implementation.s016', 'implementation', '实施性研究', '针刺适配框架 · ERIC', 'Acupuncture-adapted · ERIC', '针刺适配框架 · ERIC', 'Acupuncture-adapted · ERIC', '0', 861),
('implementation.s017', 'implementation', '实施性研究', 'ERIC 针刺版策略智能匹配', 'ERIC strategy intelligent matching (acupuncture)', 'ERIC 针刺版策略智能匹配', 'ERIC strategy intelligent matching (acupuncture)', '0', 862),
('implementation.s018', 'implementation', '实施性研究', '针刺适配版 ERIC（实施变革专家推荐）策略库。按类别筛选，或按策略所应对的 CFIR 障碍筛选——它正是 CFIR 工具推荐所依据的同一套策略库。', 'An acupuncture-adapted library of ERIC (Expert Recommendations for Implementing Change) strategies. Filter by category, or by the CFIR barrier a strategy addresses. It is the same library that powers the CFIR tool’s recommendations.', '针刺适配版 ERIC（实施变革专家推荐）策略库。按类别筛选，或按策略所应对的 CFIR 障碍筛选——它正是 CFIR 工具推荐所依据的同一套策略库。', 'An acupuncture-adapted library of ERIC (Expert Recommendations for Implementing Change) strategies. Filter by category, or by the CFIR barrier a strategy addresses. It is the same library that powers the CFIR tool’s recommendations.', '0', 863),
('implementation.s019', 'implementation', '实施性研究', '针刺适配框架 · RE-AIM', 'Acupuncture-adapted · RE-AIM', '针刺适配框架 · RE-AIM', 'Acupuncture-adapted · RE-AIM', '0', 864),
('implementation.s020', 'implementation', '实施性研究', 'RE-AIM 针刺版转化评价', 'RE-AIM translation evaluation (acupuncture)', 'RE-AIM 针刺版转化评价', 'RE-AIM translation evaluation (acupuncture)', '0', 865),
('implementation.s021', 'implementation', '实施性研究', '从触及、有效性、采纳、实施、维持五个维度，评价一个针刺项目在真实世界中的转化价值。下方为某门诊针刺镇痛项目的示例评价卡。', 'Evaluate the real-world translational value of an acupuncture programme across five dimensions: Reach, Effectiveness, Adoption, Implementation and Maintenance. Below is an illustrative scorecard for a sample outpatient acupuncture-analgesia programme.', '从触及、有效性、采纳、实施、维持五个维度，评价一个针刺项目在真实世界中的转化价值。下方为某门诊针刺镇痛项目的示例评价卡。', 'Evaluate the real-world translational value of an acupuncture programme across five dimensions: Reach, Effectiveness, Adoption, Implementation and Maintenance. Below is an illustrative scorecard for a sample outpatient acupuncture-analgesia programme.', '0', 866),
