('implementation.contextPh', 'implementation', '实施性研究', '例如：我科室想在门诊常规开展针刺镇痛，但年轻医生操作不规范、缺乏标准化培训；西医科室转诊意愿低；医院对针刺项目没有绩效激励；患者对针具有顾虑、依从性差……', 'e.g. We want to offer acupuncture analgesia routinely in our outpatient clinic, but junior clinicians'' technique varies and there is no standardised training; referral from Western-medicine departments is low; the hospital offers no performance incentive for acupuncture; patients are wary of needles and adherence is poor…', '例如：我科室想在门诊常规开展针刺镇痛，但年轻医生操作不规范、缺乏标准化培训；西医科室转诊意愿低；医院对针刺项目没有绩效激励；患者对针具有顾虑、依从性差……', 'e.g. We want to offer acupuncture analgesia routinely in our outpatient clinic, but junior clinicians'' technique varies and there is no standardised training; referral from Western-medicine departments is low; the hospital offers no performance incentive for acupuncture; patients are wary of needles and adherence is poor…', '0', 887),
