('srd.s029', 'srd', 'SRD 重复性评估', '四个领域分为两个<b>关键领域</b>（<b>研究主题</b>与<b>研究结果</b> <span class="keych">关键</span>），以及两个非关键领域：研究方法与研究质量。', 'The four domains split into two <b>key</b> domains (<b>Study topic</b> and <b>Study results</b> <span class=''keych''>KEY</span>) plus two non-key domains: Study methods and Study quality.', '四个领域分为两个<b>关键领域</b>（<b>研究主题</b>与<b>研究结果</b> <span class="keych">关键</span>），以及两个非关键领域：研究方法与研究质量。', 'The four domains split into two <b>key</b> domains (<b>Study topic</b> and <b>Study results</b> <span class=''keych''>KEY</span>) plus two non-key domains: Study methods and Study quality.', '1', 1039),
('srd.s030', 'srd', 'SRD 重复性评估', '整体结论按矩阵查表得出：两个关键领域的综合状态决定行，非关键领域的状态决定列。关键领域重叠越高，整体结论越高。', 'The overall verdict is looked up from a matrix: the combined state of the two key domains sets the row, and the state of the non-key domains sets the column. Higher key-domain overlap dominates the result.', '整体结论按矩阵查表得出：两个关键领域的综合状态决定行，非关键领域的状态决定列。关键领域重叠越高，整体结论越高。', 'The overall verdict is looked up from a matrix: the combined state of the two key domains sets the row, and the state of the non-key domains sets the column. Higher key-domain overlap dominates the result.', '0', 1040),
('srd.s031', 'srd', 'SRD 重复性评估', '示例：若两个关键领域均为「中度/高度」，无论非关键领域如何，整体判定为高度重复。', 'Example: if both key domains are “moderate/high”, the overall verdict is High regardless of the non-key domains.', '示例：若两个关键领域均为「中度/高度」，无论非关键领域如何，整体判定为高度重复。', 'Example: if both key domains are “moderate/high”, the overall verdict is High regardless of the non-key domains.', '0', 1041),
