('srd._desc', 'srd', 'SRD 重复性评估', 'ACTION 系统综述重复性评估工具（SRD）：导入两篇系统综述，基于 SRD 工具清单（4 领域约 40 条目）与整体判定计算方法，由 AI 逐条评估重复程度，输出含判定、依据说明与原文引用的详细表格，可导出。', 'ACTION Systematic Review Duplication (SRD) tool: import two systematic reviews and let AI assess overlap item by item against the SRD checklist (4 domains, ~40 items) and its overall-verdict matrix, producing an exportable table with verdicts, rationale and source quotations.', 'ACTION 系统综述重复性评估工具（SRD）：导入两篇系统综述，基于 SRD 工具清单（4 领域约 40 条目）与整体判定计算方法，由 AI 逐条评估重复程度，输出含判定、依据说明与原文引用的详细表格，可导出。', 'ACTION Systematic Review Duplication (SRD) tool: import two systematic reviews and let AI assess overlap item by item against the SRD checklist (4 domains, ~40 items) and its overall-verdict matrix, producing an exportable table with verdicts, rationale and source quotations.', '0', 1048),
