('srd.rt1Desc', 'srd', 'SRD 重复性评估', '存在会改变解读的实质差异，但仍有明确共同部分', 'A material difference that changes the reading, but a clear common core remains', '存在会改变解读的实质差异，但仍有明确共同部分', 'A material difference that changes the reading, but a clear common core remains', '0', 1083),
