('srd.rtUnclearDesc', 'srd', 'SRD 重复性评估', '两篇都没写清楚，无法判定；既不进分子也不进分母', 'Neither review reports it clearly, so no judgement is possible — excluded from both numerator and denominator', '两篇都没写清楚，无法判定；既不进分子也不进分母', 'Neither review reports it clearly, so no judgement is possible — excluded from both numerator and denominator', '0', 1085),
('srd.scoreFormula', 'srd', 'SRD 重复性评估', '分越高越重复。领域满分 = 3 × 条目数（领域 1 /24、领域 2 /18、领域 3 /42、领域 4 /18，合计 /102）；重复百分比 = 得分 ÷ 满分 × 100，再按下表分级。证据不足的条目连同它那 3 分一起剔出分母 —— 两篇都没写清楚不等于两篇做法相同。', 'Higher scores mean more duplication. Domain maximum = 3 × number of items (Domain 1 /24, Domain 2 /18, Domain 3 /42, Domain 4 /18; /102 in total). Duplication % = score ÷ maximum × 100, then binned by the scale below. Items with insufficient evidence are dropped from the denominator together with their 3 points — two reviews both being vague is not the same as two reviews doing the same thing.', '分越高越重复。领域满分 = 3 × 条目数（领域 1 /24、领域 2 /18、领域 3 /42、领域 4 /18，合计 /102）；重复百分比 = 得分 ÷ 满分 × 100，再按下表分级。证据不足的条目连同它那 3 分一起剔出分母 —— 两篇都没写清楚不等于两篇做法相同。', 'Higher scores mean more duplication. Domain maximum = 3 × number of items (Domain 1 /24, Domain 2 /18, Domain 3 /42, Domain 4 /18; /102 in total). Duplication % = score ÷ maximum × 100, then binned by the scale below. Items with insufficient evidence are dropped from the denominator together with their 3 points — two reviews both being vague is not the same as two reviews doing the same thing.', '0', 1086),
('srd.scoreDropped', 'srd', 'SRD 重复性评估', '名义满分 {full} 分，本次有 {n} 个条目证据不足、已连同其分值一并剔出分母。', 'Nominal maximum is {full}. In this run {n} item(s) had insufficient evidence and were dropped from the denominator along with their points.', '名义满分 {full} 分，本次有 {n} 个条目证据不足、已连同其分值一并剔出分母。', 'Nominal maximum is {full}. In this run {n} item(s) had insufficient evidence and were dropped from the denominator along with their points.', '0', 1087),
